  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Binding Ritual. Create a level 1...10...12 spirit. Whenever a non-spirit ally in its range takes damage or life steal, it is reduced by 15 and the spirit takes 15 damage. This spirit dies after 30...54...60 seconds.",
      "zhTW": "創造一個等級1～12的 聯合縛靈，每當範圍內的非靈盟友遭受傷害或者偷取生命時，將被減少15，同時靈受到15傷害，靈在30～60秒後死亡。"
    },
    "pvp": {
      "en": "Binding Ritual. Create a level 1...7...8 spirit. Whenever a non-spirit ally in its range takes damage or life steal, it is reduced by 15 and the spirit takes 15 damage. This spirit dies after 30...54...60 seconds.",
      "zhTW": "召喚等級 1～8 的靈體，持續 30～60 秒。範圍內非靈體友軍受到傷害或體力偷取時，減少 15 點，靈體則受到 15 傷害。"
    }
  },
